<section class="auth-shell shell">
    <div class="auth-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Nueva cuenta</span><h1>Entrá al flujo completo del proyecto.</h1><p>Al registrarte se crea automáticamente un carrito asociado a tu usuario.</p><div class="auth-points"><span>01 · Usuario</span><span>02 · Carrito</span><span>03 · Sesión</span></div></div>
    <div class="auth-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Registro</span><h2>Creá tu cuenta.</h2>
        <form data-api-form data-endpoint="/api/session/register" data-success="/login">
            <div class="field-grid"><label>Nombre<input type="text" name="first_name" autocomplete="given-name" required></label><label>Apellido<input type="text" name="last_name" autocomplete="family-name" required></label></div>
            <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="tu@email.com"></label>
            <label>Contraseña<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="6" required placeholder="Mínimo 6 caracteres"></label>
            <button class="button button-primary button-wide" type="submit">Crear cuenta</button>
            <p class="form-status" data-form-status></p>
        </form>
        <p class="auth-switch">¿Ya tenés cuenta? <a href="/login">Ingresá</a></p>
    </div>
</section>
